      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This green-feathered, armless birdman swoops down from cavern roofs to menace unwary travelers, strong gusts of wind blowing around it constantly. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 18, touch 15, flat-footed 13 (+4 Dex, +1 dodge, +3 natural)</p><p>hp 42 [65] (5d10+15)</p><p>mp 11</p><p>Fort +4, Ref +8, Will +4</p><p>Resist earth 5</p><p>Weakness wind</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., fly 60 ft. (average)</p><p>Melee bite +8 (1d6+2), 2 talons +8 (1d4+2)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Iron Nail</p><p>Spells Known (FC CL 5th; concentration +7)</p><p>2nd (DC 14) - Aero II</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 15, Dex 18, Con 16, Int 8, Wis 11, Cha 15</p><p>Base Atk +5; CMB +7; CMD 27</p><p>Feats Dodge, Flyby Attack, Weapon Finesse</p><p>Skills Intimidate +10, Fly +12, Perception +8</p><p>Languages Auran</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment arctic caves</p><p>Organization small group (1-3)</p><p>Treasure normal</p>"
      }
